DESCRIPTION:📚🗣️🔖\nJoin KGO Adult Literacy Program to celebrate 
 the power of literacy through an intimate fireside chat with an adult lear
 ner\, Paulette Walcott\, who recently authored her first book. Through per
 sonal stories and reflection\, Paulette will share how learning opened new
  possibilities\, built confidence\, and helped bring her voice and story t
 o life.\nPresented by KGO Adult Literacy Program and A Different Booklist.
 \nFree to attend. Everyone is welcome - #ReadDifferently!📚
